{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"1883","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/waLbm384SQDwLTCn6ttPqQS5kfV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uQUHCqxHsG9blvtCoL7vluMG9Jp.jpg","description":"Follow the Dutton family as they embark on a journey west through the Great Plains toward the last bastion of untamed America. A stark retelling of Western expansion, and an intense study of one family fleeing poverty to seek a better future in America’s promised land — Montana.\n\nRated TV-MA · Ended · First aired 19 Dec 2021 · United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: 101 Studios, Linson Entertainment, Bosque Ranch Productions · Network: Paramount+\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Drama","Western","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"1883","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2021-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Dutton family embarks on a journey west through the last bastion of untamed America. James arrives in Texas, where he and his family prepare to make their way through The Great Plains in search of a new home and the promise of opportunity.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xwGZylrUoMDnioy0DRmMnpY3WQf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Behind Us, A Cliff","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2021-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Thomas and Shea recruit James and some local cowboys to corral a herd of cattle. As they begin their journey, the caravan is confronted with some of the many dangers they will face along the way.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rdNWQjFESo9nqNZSAmlPVSDhloA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"River","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2021-12-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"James butts heads with Shea and Thomas about an important decision. Tensions rise in camp when an accusation is made. Elsa begins a flirtation with a cowboy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vtvlsFhen064XrpWfQWecx9dw5e.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The Crossing","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2022-01-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The group faces the harrowing task of crossing the river with their wagons and supplies. Thomas and Noemi grow closer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j1TGBsRsHnI1mDh7aI2R12ztjus.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"The Fangs of Freedom","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2022-01-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Shea and Thomas cope with the aftermath of the river crossing, but there is little time to grieve and no shortage of challenges ahead. Elsa and Ennis share a romantic moment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5QsxHkxXcktqunh40xJJfdnTvI5.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Boring The Devil","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2022-01-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Shea helps Elsa cope with her loss. The group crosses another river and prepares to enter Indian territory. Thomas buys Noemi a gift.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4SUAp585VcBRhgKVQUfntCGtAel.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxLzE4ODMlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Lightning Yellow Hair","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2022-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Elsa makes an unlikely friend. The group faces a harrowing challenge from mother nature. The camp searches fo